5
00:00:15,822 --> 00:00:18,522
(Leonard:)You know, I do understand
what you're feeling.

6
00:00:18,525 --> 00:00:20,455
(Leonard:)My brother and sister's
accomplishments

7
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,360
